@CloudForge.Api_HostAddress = https://localhost:7274
### Post instances
POST {{CloudForge.Api_HostAddress}}/api/instances
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "id": 1,
    "name": "MyInstance",
    "isComplete": false
}

### Get all instances
GET {{CloudForge.Api_HostAddress}}/api/instances
Accept: application/json

### Get instance by ID
GET {{CloudForge.Api_HostAddress}}/api/instances/1
Accept: application/json

### Delete instance
DELETE {{CloudForge.Api_HostAddress}}/api/instances/2
